# Pyrrhic Strike with its blight paid targets Bot2's Mox Pearl (first mode) and Hero of Bladehold (second mode). In
# response Bot2 exiles its own Hero of Bladehold with Swords to Plowshares (paid with Lotus Petal), so the second mode's
# target is illegal as the spell resolves; the spell still resolves, the first mode destroys Mox Pearl and the second does
# nothing (CR 608.2b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Endurance
Pyrrhic Strike
Plains x2
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Lotus Petal
Hero of Bladehold
Swords to Plowshares
Island x2
Island x20

