Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Hero of Bladehold.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyrrhic Strike.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Blight 2)
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Target(Hero of Bladehold)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Endurance)
